      "idRef": {
        "id": "9c133d036c58588ba3dc826c"
      },
      "index": 0,
      "text": "So, you failed to find the [[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[LoreInheritors],Inheritor]] leadership at the location I provided and now you claim to have attacked a civilian [[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[LoreFarLookers],Far-Looker]] settlement and destroyed it.\n\nI fear that this is a matter that will have to be referred to the Concordat's courts because of the criminal charges involved.",
