    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9ca0199c51303956f6102226"
      },
      "index": 6,
      "text": "Careful where you are treading at Mr. Oliveira, or you might find someone will unexpectedly cut you down, if you poke the bull too much.\n\nYou'll be paid in full and your contract is complete, <i>adiós</i>.",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "",
          "conditions": null,
